flowchart TB
    INPUT[Conversation input] --> AUTH[Authenticate + authorize scope]
    AUTH --> POLICY[Secrets + machine policy]
    POLICY --> PRECEDENCE{Explicit operation?}
    PRECEDENCE -->|yes| EXPLICIT[Explicit remember · correct · forget path]
    PRECEDENCE -->|no| SHADOW[Shadow extractor]
    SHADOW --> CANDIDATE[Typed candidate · provenance · confidence]
    CANDIDATE --> REVIEW[Human review + audit]
    REVIEW --> CATEGORY[Per-category evidence registry]
    CATEGORY --> GATE{100 cases + quality + calibration + agreement + approval?}
    GATE -->|no| OFF[Remain shadow · zero canonical writes]
    GATE -->|yes| AUTO[Enable category automatically]
    AUTO --> MONITOR[Monitor quality + hard safety]
    MONITOR -->|regression| PAUSE[Pause or rollback to shadow]
    MONITOR -->|healthy| AUTO

    classDef input fill:#e6f0ff,stroke:#2666a8,color:#17324d;
    classDef safe fill:#dcf3e5,stroke:#26834f,color:#173c29;
    classDef eval fill:#eee6ff,stroke:#7041b5,color:#371866;
    classDef stop fill:#ffdadd,stroke:#c93643,color:#65141c;

    class INPUT,SHADOW,CANDIDATE input
    class AUTH,POLICY,PRECEDENCE,EXPLICIT,REVIEW safe
    class CATEGORY,GATE,MONITOR eval
    class OFF,PAUSE stop
    class AUTO safe
